----

= Trust Recommendations =

You buff: March / Madrigal / Ballad / Minuet — //bard trusts are wasted on you//. You need a **tank**, a **healer**, and **pure DPS**.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/August">August</a></strong></td><td>Tank</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Karaha-Baruha">Karaha-Baruha</a></strong></td><td>Healer with Haste + Bar-element — doesn't overlap with your songs</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Zeid_II">Zeid II</a></strong></td><td>DPS + 4 stun gambits</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Ayame">Ayame</a></strong></td><td>Self-sufficient SAM DPS</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>💃 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Uka_Totlihn">Uka Totlihn</a></strong></td><td>Quickstep / Violent Flourish + Drain Samba — DNC utility stacks with your songs</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

