<tr><td class="lv">40</td><td><span class="eg">⭐</span> <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Chanter%27s_Staff">Chanter's Staff</a></strong> <em>(CHR+6 Singing Skill+4)</em></td><td>Better than Monster Signa due to Singing Skill+4.</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">51</td><td><strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Elemental_Staves">Elemental Staves</a></strong></td><td>Macro-switch for debuffs. <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Light_Staff">Light</a></strong> / <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Apollo%27s_Staff">Apollo's</a></strong> for Lullaby/Finale/Requiem · <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Earth_Staff">Earth</a></strong> / <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Terra%27s_Staff">Terra's</a></strong> for Elegy. Keep Chanter's for buffs.</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">73</td><td><strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Alkalurops">Alkalurops</a></strong> <em>(HP-10 INT/MND/CHR+10 M.Acc+20)</em></td><td>Won't replace HQ staves. Drops from Tinnin (ZNM Tier IV).</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

